Package: stagemap
Title: Relation Maps for 'Shiny' and 'Quarto'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Harsh", "Verma", email = "analyticswithharsh@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Builds relation maps from cards placed by stage and lane and
    links that join them. Checks card identifiers, link endpoints and column
    values, lays the map out the same way on every run and draws it in the
    browser, in 'Shiny' apps and 'Quarto' documents.
